        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "6ff5781b-e951-5082-8da4-060ee2b45e02",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: As You Like It (2006 film), As You Like It\n- People: Kenneth Branagh, William Shakespeare, Bryce Dallas Howard, David Oyelowo, Romola Garai, Adrian Lester, Alfred Molina, Kevin Kline, Janet McTeer, Brian Blessed\n- Characters: Rosalind, Orlando De Boys, Celia, Oliver De Boys, Touchstone, Jaques, Audrey, Duke Frederick, Duke Senior\n\nFacts:\n- William Shakespeare wrote the play As You Like It.\n- Touchstone is a fictional character in William Shakespeare's play As You Like It.\n- As You Like It is a 2006 film based on William Shakespeare's play As You Like It.\n- Kenneth Branagh wrote and directed the 2006 film As You Like It.\n- Bryce Dallas Howard plays Rosalind in the 2006 film As You Like It.\n- David Oyelowo plays Orlando De Boys in the 2006 film As You Like It.\n- Romola Garai plays Celia in the 2006 film As You Like It.\n- Adrian Lester plays Oliver De Boys in the 2006 film As You Like It.\n- Alfred Molina plays Touchstone in the 2006 film As You Like It.\n- Kevin Kline plays Jaques in the 2006 film As You Like It.\n- Janet McTeer plays Audrey in the 2006 film As You Like It.\n- Brian Blessed plays both Duke Frederick and Duke Senior in the 2006 film As You Like It.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
